Defect: STATUS CODE REPORTING THE WRAPPER rather than the work.  
Line 175-177. Exact input: `ROMOSOZUMAB_OP_REVIEW.html = "x"`, `PBC_PPAR_REVIEW.html = "x"`, no `*_REVIEW.html` contains `'FIDELITY pooled analysis'`; run `python scripts/fix_data_quality_issues.py --apply`. Consequence: all three repairs can do zero work and the process still exits 0, so a gate would report the wrapper succeeded rather than that the defects were fixed.

Defect: SELECTOR KEYED TO A FORM THE CORPUS DOES NOT USE / exact-form selector.  
Line 151. Exact input in any non-FINERENONE `*_REVIEW.html`: `const PUBLISHED_META_BENCHMARKS={ MACE:[{ label:'FIDELITY pooled analysis' }] };`. Consequence: the placeholder remains because the marker requires exactly `const PUBLISHED_META_BENCHMARKS = {`.

